# Catálogo base del juego y página de tienda (Inglés — idioma fuente canónico)

# Marca y tienda (7)
game-title = HUSHMINE
store-tagline = Rob a sleeping mountain. Play dirty. Keep it hushed.
store-short-desc = Rob a sleeping mountain. Play dirty. Keep it hushed. Competitive 1v1 to 8v8 voxel mining where two crews dig for gold, rig bucket lines, sabotage rivals with lava and charges, and gamble with a shared Seismograph before the Sleeper wakes.
store-premise-1931 = 1931. Mount Anima was the richest mountain on Earth, and miners came from every corner of the world to dig it. Then, one night, the mountain woke up. The entire graveyard shift — forty-one miners from twelve countries — never came back up. Their brass tallies still hang missing from the board.
store-premise-1979 = 1979. The mountain sleeps again… and it dreams of gold. Every time it settles, its tunnels shift and fresh veins bloom. Every night, rival crews slip past the fences to rob a sleeping giant.
store-premise-rule = The old-timers have one rule: don't wake the Sleeper.
store-season-one = Season 1: The Long Night

